abstract: >-
  A single installable agent skill merging eight upstream academic-skills repositories,
  with a 22-part progressive-disclosure reference library, a dependency-free Python CLI,
  a 5,434-entry unified registry, ten quality gates, and lossless SHA-256-verified
  archives of all source code.
